\x1b[1mBox Background Examples:\x1b[22m\n\n1. Standard red background (10x3):\n\n\x1b[41mHello     \x1b[49m\n\x1b[41m          \x1b[49m\n\x1b[41m          \x1b[49m\n\n2. Blue background with border (12x4):\n\n\u256d\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256e\n\u2502\x1b[44mBorder    \x1b[49m\u2502\n\u2502\x1b[44m          \x1b[49m\u2502\n\u2570\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u256f\n\n3. Green background with padding (14x4):\n\n\x1b[42m              \x1b[49m\n\x1b[42m Padding      \x1b[49m\n\x1b[42m              \x1b[49m\n\x1b[42m              \x1b[49m\n\n4. Yellow background with center alignment (16x3):\n\n\x1b[43m    Centered    \x1b[49m\n\x1b[43m                \x1b[49m\n\x1b[43m                \x1b[49m\n\n5. Magenta background, column layout (12x5):\n\n\x1b[45mLine 1      \x1b[49m\n\x1b[45mLine 2      \x1b[49m\n\x1b[45m            \x1b[49m\n\x1b[45m            \x1b[49m\n\x1b[45m            \x1b[49m\n\n6. Hex color background #FF8800 (10x3):\n\n\x1b[48;5;214mHex       \x1b[49m\n\x1b[48;5;214m          \x1b[49m\n\x1b[48;5;214m          \x1b[49m\n\n7. RGB background rgb(0,255,0) (10x3):\n\n\x1b[48;5;46mRGB       \x1b[49m\n\x1b[48;5;46m          \x1b[49m\n\x1b[48;5;46m          \x1b[49m\n\n8. Text inheritance test:\n\n\x1b[46mInherited \x1b[41mOverride \x1b[46mBack to inherited\x1b[49m\n\n9. Nested background inheritance:\n\n\x1b[44mOuter: \x1b[43mInner: \x1b[41mDeep\x1b[49m\n\n\nPress Ctrl+C to exit
